        "timestamp": 1794937832
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"memo\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4dd\" role=\"img\" title=\"memo\">:memo:</span> cfallin submitted <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/15228#pullrequestreview-5948983183\">PR review</a>.</p>",
        "id": 641410880,
        "sender_full_name": "Wasmtime GitHub notifications bot",
        "timestamp": 1794961994
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> cfallin created <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/15228#discussion_r4607687217\">PR review comment</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Good thought generally! But: these actually become <code>.to_unrooted(store)</code> in the next PR, which I think is probably the better option anyway (these are short-lived temporary references used to query the heap so no actual need for rooting); so to avoid rebase churn when this will change again anyway I'll leave these as-is.</p>\n</blockquote>",
